      "after": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"en-PK\">A vibrant opening of sparkling tangerine, spicy ginger and luminous aldehydes creates an invigorating first impression. A graceful heart of rose and blossoms unfolds with intriguing smoky nuances, adding depth and character. The fragrance settles into a warm, sophisticated blend of musk, sandalwood, amber and patchouli, leaving a memorable trail.</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US;\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US;\"><strong>Main Accords:</strong><br>Top Notes: Tangerine, Ginger, Aldehydes <br>Heart Notes: Rose, Blossom, Smoky Notes <br>Base Notes: Musk, Santamanol, Amber, Patchouli</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US;\"><strong>Size: </strong>100ml</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>GTIN:</strong> 6298043241052</p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">(!) Fragrances and perfumes are not shipped internationally due to the courier and airline DG policy.</span></p>"
