      "after": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"en-PK\">An invigorating blend of Calabrian bergamot, crisp fruits and refreshing aquatic notes opens this captivating fragrance. Delicate Indian jasmine and violet unfold into a rich ambergris heart, adding depth and elegance. A luxurious base of oud, cashmere wood, tonka bean and white musk leaves a warm, sophisticated and lasting impression.</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"en-PK\"><strong>Category: </strong>Ambery, Oriental, Ambergris, Oud </span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"en-PK\"><strong>Main Accods:</strong><br>Top Notes: Citrus Bergamot Of Calabria, Green Apple, Williams Pear, Elemi, Aquatic Notes<br></span><span lang=\"en-PK\">Heart Notes: Floral Indian Jasmine, Violet, Violet Leaves, Ambergris, Amberwood<br></span><span style=\"font-size: 0.875rem;\">Base Notes: Oriental Oud, Cashmere Wood, Fava Tonka, Oak Moss, White Musk</span></p>\n<p><strong>Size:</strong> 100ml</p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">(!) Fragrances and perfumes are not shipped internationally due to the courier and airline DG policy.</span><br></p>"
